#: ../../entities/895.rst:1
msgid "Zhangjiang Hi-Tech 895 Incubator"
msgstr "张江高科895孵化器"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:4
msgid "张江高科895孵化器"
msgstr "张江高科895孵化器"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:6
msgid "Incubator | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "孵化器｜浦东新区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Hardware AI, Chips."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI硬件、芯片。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:10
msgid ""
"A deep-technology incubator with chip-testing and industrialization "
"context in Zhangjiang. Incubation and the associated angel investment "
"pathway must be reviewed as different agreements."
msgstr "张江硬科技孵化器，可对接芯片测试及产业化资源。孵化服务与天使投资的条件应分别审阅，并签订相应协议。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S004 "
"<https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-Latest-WhatsNew/20260724/5ae78c565d2449cf96e42595a8e5422e.html>`_. "
"Shanghai uses innovation ecosystems to nurture future industries."
msgstr "`资料来源 S004 <https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-Latest-WhatsNew/20260724/5ae78c565d2449cf96e42595a8e5422e.html>`_. Shanghai uses innovation ecosystems to nurture future industries."

#: ../../entities/895.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-Latest-WhatsNew/20260724/5ae78c565d2449cf96e42595a8e5422e.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方资料及主管部门 <https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-Latest-WhatsNew/20260724/5ae78c565d2449cf96e42595a8e5422e.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:35
msgid "Send a project brief and request the current admission checklist."
msgstr "发送项目简介，索取最新入驻条件及材料清单。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:37
msgid ""
"Complete the operator's eligibility and technical or commercial review."
msgstr "按运营机构要求完成资格审核及技术或商业评审。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:39
msgid ""
"Confirm rent, service fees, IP, compute pricing and any equity rights in "
"writing."
msgstr "书面确认租金、服务费、知识产权、算力价格及股权相关条款。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:41
msgid ""
"Sign the agreed admission documents and record milestones and support "
"owners."
msgstr "签署入驻协议，明确阶段目标和服务对接人。"

#: ../../entities/895.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Pudong district route </districts/pudong>`"
msgstr ":doc:`浦东新区合作指南 </districts/pudong>`"

